+ * Copyright (c) 2010 Baptiste Coudurier
+ * Copyright (c) 2011 Stefano Sabatini
+ * Copyright (c) 2013 Vittorio Giovara <vittorio.giovara@gmail.com>
+ * Copyright (c) 2017 Thomas Mundt <tmundt75@gmail.com>
