+ * @param buf destination buffer
+ * @param buf_size destination buffer size
+ * @param path numbered sequence string
+ * @param number frame number
+ * @param flags AV_FRAME_FILENAME_FLAGS_*
+ * @return 0 if OK, -1 on format error
